  "blocks": {
    "宿主适配测试文稿--paragraph-1": {
      "id": "宿主适配测试文稿--paragraph-1",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "宿主适配测试文稿--paragraph-1--text-0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "插件之间的服务依赖、步骤驱动的组件、动画、错误边界与步骤作用域。组件与三个演示插件来自本目录的测试插件 "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "./plugin",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " 与 "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "./services",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "core--paragraph-1": {
      "id": "core--paragraph-1",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "core--paragraph-1--text-0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "本章演示宿主适配：插件之间通过服务协作，组件的状态由步骤推导，动画尊重减少动态效果的设置，出错的组件只影响自身。组件与三个演示插件来自本目录的测试插件 "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "plugin",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " 与 "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "services",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "core--paragraph-2": {
      "id": "core--paragraph-2",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "core--paragraph-2--text-0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "服务依赖",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "：消费方插件拿到提供方的实现"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "core--demo-greeting-1": {
      "id": "core--demo-greeting-1",
      "type": "component",
      "definitionId": "core--demo-greeting-1--definition",
      "parameters": {}
    },
    "core--paragraph-3": {
      "id": "core--paragraph-3",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "core--paragraph-3--text-0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "fixture.host.provider 提供问候服务，fixture.host.consumer 依赖它，fixture.host.orphan 缺少必需服务而被禁用。启动报告显示在演讲者视图的 Presmium 面板中。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "core--paragraph-4": {
      "id": "core--paragraph-4",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "core--paragraph-4--text-0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "步骤驱动",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "：状态由步骤推导，跳转与逐步前进一致"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "core--demo-stepper-1": {
      "id": "core--demo-stepper-1",
      "type": "component",
      "definitionId": "core--demo-stepper-1--definition",
      "parameters": {
        "steps": [
          "解析文稿",
          "启动插件",
          "渲染页面"
        ]
      }
    },
    "core--paragraph-5": {
      "id": "core--paragraph-5",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "core--paragraph-5--text-0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "步进组件有三个标签，占用三步：每一步显示并突出一个标签。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "core--paragraph-6": {
      "id": "core--paragraph-6",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "core--paragraph-6--text-0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "第一步突出“解析文稿”：步进组件的状态完全由步骤推导。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "core--paragraph-7": {
      "id": "core--paragraph-7",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "core--paragraph-7--text-0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "第二步突出“启动插件”。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "core--paragraph-8": {
      "id": "core--paragraph-8",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "core--paragraph-8--text-0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "第三步突出“渲染页面”：直接跳到这一步与从第零步逐步前进到这里，页面完全一致。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "core--paragraph-9": {
      "id": "core--paragraph-9",
      "type": "text",
